  - .slm runtime parser now rejects zero checksums and mismatched checksums before accepting model files.
  - Earlier checksum enforcement regenerated the pre-BPE local .slm artifact set; current artifact count is eight including the BPE fixture and tied-output fixture.
  - Full Visual Studio browser helper passed again after checksum-bearing artifact regeneration with -BrowserSmoke -PerformanceSoak -PerformanceSoakCycles 3 -PerformanceSoakTokens 4.
