  model_breeding_concept_routes:
    - heritable artifacts: .slm files, manifests, adapter packages, module-plan receipts, assembly receipts, eval sidecars, selector entries, and Model Provenance Artifact rows.
    - mate selection: compatibility reports, population reviews, parent-pool recipes, relatedness checksums, seed weights, and objective vectors.
    - phenotype evidence: runtime-smoke sidecars, eval-case evidence checksums, Model Provenance rows, browser smokes, and promotion ledgers.
    - speciation and fit: f32/q8_0/q4_0 families, tokenizer families, tensor layouts, adapter families, and browser resource envelopes.
